      "fill": "$ink_soft",
      "content": "creator_card is the sole owner of the mirror caption effect; fallback opaque strip when image missing / blur unavailable; whole card → creator profile; name+discipline is the accessible name; do_not_invent: followers, rating, verification badge, location city, online status. Server-owned values: fullName, discipline, workCount, profilePhoto asset id. Role variations: public discovery. card_lift + media zoom; focus ring; pressed scale .98. mirror_caption: mirrored bottom slice, blur 20, mirror_caption_veil."
