      "content": "fullName is the page h1; region labeled «Автор»; portrait alt «Портрет: {fullName}»; «Ещё» is a real button with expanded state announced; share opens native share sheet / web share API — visible share label string is absent from specs: render icon-only + caption note «Missing spec: share label string»; statement text = shortDescription (200-char truncation is a display rule); follow_creator slot is designed_post_mvp — never rendered here; do_not_invent: followers, rating, verification, edit-profile affordance, location beyond country, price/deadline. Server-owned values: creator identity, statusCounts, shortDescription, links, portrait asset. Role variations: public creator profile. stack_settle; reduced_motion: no entrance settle, instant expansion."
