    {
      "id": "Q8ZQQk",
      "type": "ref",
      "ref": "Rf9zi",
      "name": "Аннотация · components/story_group/board",
      "x": 1664,
      "y": 38873.36050756956,
      "width": 420,
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "fill": "$ink_soft",
      "content": "steps are semantically an ordered list; images alt from step titles or «Процесс, шаг N»; facts are a definition list; links announce «Telegram, внешняя ссылка»; fixture step images are 3:4 while the step image slot is 4:3 — cover-crop, note the ratio difference; do_not_invent: author quotes, pull-quotes, video slots as MVP controls, timestamps, private contacts, follower counts, DM buttons, authentication certificates, appraisal value, shipping calculator. Server-owned values: story, uniqueness, provenance, ordered creation steps, facts, delivery, public links. Role variations: public work detail. stack_settle and gallery_advance; reduced_motion: no tilt settle and instant rail swap."
    },
